  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  BetaSx
  @  Standard deviation of the law.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 2; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 2 == THEN Explode Drop ELSE IF DUP Size 3 == THEN Explode Drop Drop ELSE "BetaSx: needs 2 arguments" DoError END END END
  → av bv « av 0 + bv 0 + → a b « '√(a*b/(((a+b)^2)*(a+b+1)))' →Num av bv 2 →List Drop » »
